ude, which may be mitigated. Also we could bring up that we have no evidence of C's adaptability, but B also has concerns. So we maintain C.\n\nWe need to reference prior discussion: Agent2 added stress resilience and technical competence for C. Agent3 argued B is better due to adaptability concerns. We'll respond.\n\nWe also have some facts about Candidate A and D not yet discussed; we could mention them as less suitable, reinforcing C. But must keep focused.\n\nThus produce public message: \"I still recommend Candidate C because...\" and metadata vote Candidate C.\n\nProceed."}
